    skos:scopeNote "This parameter concerns the level crossing of the railway with a road or a street. Provision the correct location of the level crossing(s) is not required, but RINF data model allows providing such information on a voluntary basis, and it can be a geographical information and/or a reference to a line referencing system."@en .

